(\225  IV thrombolysis \(tPA / Tenecteplase\) is approved within 4.5 hours of symptom onset in eligible patients without hemorrhage on non-contrast head CT.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
60 593 Td
(\225  Blood pressure must be lowered to <185/110 mmHg prior to thrombolysis and maintained <180/105 mmHg for 24 hours post-infusion \(using Labetalol or Nicardipine\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
60 571 Td
